    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Original Storyline -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fantastic oriental martial arts world has been created, where there are ruthless bandits and villains, traitors who betray their masters, and touching stories of family ties. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Exciting Combat -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting side-scrolling combat, rich combat effects, and smooth skill expression bring back classic arcade gameplay and provide the most splendid combat experience! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various Gameplay Options -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a variety of PVE and PVP gameplay options. You can choose to play through the story mode and enjoy a feast of battles and plot, experiencing the dark martial arts story. You can also challenge other players in the arena and experience the thrill of the sword-and-dagger world of martial arts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Heroes Unite - Each character in the game has a unique set of combat moves, giving you a diverse combat experience and unlocking more hero characters to make your martial arts journey less lonely!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Original Storyline -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fantastic oriental martial arts world has been created, where there are ruthless bandits and villains, traitors who betray their masters, and touching stories of family ties. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Exciting Combat -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting side-scrolling combat, rich combat effects, and smooth skill expression bring back classic arcade gameplay and provide the most splendid combat experience! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various Gameplay Options -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a variety of PVE and PVP gameplay options. You can choose to play through the story mode and enjoy a feast of battles and plot, experiencing the dark martial arts story. You can also challenge other players in the arena and experience the thrill of the sword-and-dagger world of martial arts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Heroes Unite - Each character in the game has a unique set of combat moves, giving you a diverse combat experience and unlocking more hero characters to make your martial arts journey less lonely!</p>",
    "short_description": "The story of &quot;Sword Shadow Lake&quot; opens with a family massacre, telling the chaotic Wuxia world under the darkness, you will play a warrior, out of the family door, set foot on the heroic river lake road of chivalrousness, to save the Central plains of the wind and rain.",
